### Get Auth token admin
### Admin token : YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin"
}

### Create user by admin
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/admin/users
Content-Type:  application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=
Accept: */*

{
  "username": "adya1997",
  "password": "verysTRongPassword33$",
  "role": "USER"
}

### Login with user parametrs Authorization: Basic YWR5YTE5OTc6dmVyeXNUUm9uZ1Bhc3N3b3JkMzMk
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "adya1997",
  "password": "verysTRongPassword33$"
}

### Create new account
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWR5YTE5OTc6dmVyeXNUUm9uZ1Bhc3N3b3JkMzMk

{
}

### №1 Positive case: Deposit money with a valid user token and correct amount
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/deposit
Authorization: Basic YWR5YTE5OTc6dmVyeXNUUm9uZ1Bhc3N3b3JkMzMk
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "balance": 100
}

### №2 Negative case: Deposit money with invalid user token and valid amount
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/deposit
Authorization: Basic YWR5YTE5OTc6dmVyeXNUUm9uZ1Bhc3N3b3JkM
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "balance": 100
}

### №3 Negative case: Deposit money without user token and valid amount
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/deposit
Authorization:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "balance": 100
}


