### Transfer money
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/transfer
Authorization: Basic YWR5YTE5OTc6dmVyeXNUUm9uZ1Bhc3N3b3JkMzMk
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "senderAccountId": 1,
  "receiverAccountId": 2,
  "amount": 50
}



### №1 Positive case: Transfer money with USER role
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/transfer
